abstract: >-
  A competition adaptation of TreeLearn for mobile-LiDAR urban street-tree
  instance segmentation on WHU-STree, including preprocessing, sparse-convolution
  training and inference, clustering, label back-projection, evaluation, and
  Codabench submission export.
